.TH SIMRV-LINUX-BUILDER-POST-BUILD 1 "November 2026" "SimRV 3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
simrv-linux-builder-post-build \- prepare a Buildroot target for SimRV
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B simrv-linux-builder-post-build
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B simrv-linux-builder-post-build
is a helper invoked by
.BR simrv-linux-builder (1)
during Buildroot image generation. It applies the SimRV image settings and
finalizes the target root filesystem. Users normally invoke the Linux Builder
instead of running this helper directly.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR simrv-linux-builder (1)
